<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">GALATE</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nga</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ngalate</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool ola baal a Ngalate</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool ola baal a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ngalate</para>
  <para style="imt">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wu, Pool mbuul wu ákel ndɛ ola baal a Ngalati kwɛn ndɛ adzuu m'ãbvɔɔn b'ébuo ndɛ me lio li éyɛn ndɛ dzwɛ li ɔ̃sal, onge b'eyɛɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu ɛ̃sal mi Antam (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15:1-10">Ɛ̃sa 15.1-10</ref></char>). Baal bakyɛ abeyɛɛn ndiri ãbvɔɔn omɔ̃ ãli ke nsie yi Adzi b'atsi-tsiri bɛn meba ŋã abeta me Tuuki. Ke ngwel wɛ, Pool ábwel okɔ ŋ'éyɛn ndɛ dzwɛ li ɔ̃sal li nsa yuaal ye li nsa ntyel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:6">Ɛ̃sa 16.6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:3">18.3</ref></char>). Baal bakyɛ bvool abeyɛɛn ndiri ãbvɔɔn omɔ̃ ãli k'etswi ki tsɛn ki Ngalati bwɛn a Lom, me ndɔɔ yɛn Pool ádzuu okɔ ŋ'éyɛn ndɛ dzwɛ li ɔ̃sal sa li ɛ̃kwel ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:14">Ɛ̃sa 13.14</ref></char>). Ɔ̃nkaan wu okoo m'okal wu ɛ̃kwel onse ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Pool, bvool ndɛ onge wu ákel ndɛ me mvel ãku-ãnã ye bva (49) ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ye k'etɔ obvɔɔn bo Yelusalem (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15">Ɛ̃sa 15</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ndɔɔ yi nkiin onse ɔ̃nkaan a Pool wu, yi awa otsɛn o Ngel a Moyize ye bo nyiĩ a Nziã.</para>
  <para style="io">Pool ayɛɛn me b'otal okam mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ ɛ̃sal mi ombuul ye nsia yi eburu Ɔ̃fel(<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:6-2:21">1.6–2.21</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ndɛ hɛ̃ ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ ãtee m'ãbi-ãbi m'ãdzeel baal a Ngalati.</para>
  <para style="io">Pool bvool asuo ɔ̃sal wu éyi Ngel osa onse baal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 3:15-29">3.15-29</ref></char>), y'emfa kyɛn okiool me Yeso Mãsia opaal mbuul onse onkyal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 4:1-8">4.1-8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ke ntɔ a ɔ̃nkaan, Pool ayɛɛn m'emfa ki akal onse omwiĩ b'Ɔ̃fel wu Õnsensal. Ndɛ hɛ̃ atam akiool k'awuaal a bakyɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 5:13-26">5.13-26</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:1-17">6.1-17</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wu asuo ãndɔɔ mbuaal m'ãbetuaal bvɔɔn mpal ãlio mbueel: okiaal o Ngel y'okal ndii. Ndɛ asuo kwɛn okal ndii bo taa-taa onse Yeso Mãsia, bo baan a Nziã.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, mɛ̃ ndi ntam wɛn ke wu éyuɔɔl baal wɛ, wɛn hɛ̃ k'ábwel me nkuul a mbuul wɛ. Kɛn a mɛ̃ ndi ntam wu éyuɔɔl Yeso Mãsia ye Nziã wu Taal, wu áseel ndɛ wu Yeso onse b'ákwi-ákwi. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Mɛ̃ y'andoo bam bueel b'ali ye mɛ̃ eswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu m'ãbvɔɔn mã nsie yi Ngalati. <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ ye Mfam Yeso Mãsia asio byɛ nyiĩ bvool awa byɛ opi! <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Ndɛ wu Mãsia wu áwi elaã e ndɛ me ndyam me ndɔɔ ãbi ã bia-byɛ, m'obvuul o bia-byɛ m'ɔ̃kiri wu ɔ̃bi wu, m'emfa ki édzii Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Yɔɔl kwɛn alweel ndɛ ɔ̃bu nzal ɔ̃bu! Amɛn!<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsia yi Ngesɛ kɛn a ngamɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Mɛ̃ ekam bibi me ndɔɔ yi etiɔ byɛ Nziã eboo tswa-a-tswa m'onɔɔn o nsia yi ngesɛ nkyam. Ndɛ wu áti byɛ mbel me nyiĩ a Mãsia. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Ke yam, nsia yi ngesɛ nkyam k'eli wɛ, eli kɛn a ye baal b'alɔ byɛ ɛ̃tsab bvool adzii k'abiil Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Mãsia. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Kɛn a ŋɛn mbuul otee byɛ nsia yi ngesɛ yi ekam ye yi étee bee byɛ, ekal bee myam, ekal ãnzwel ngamɔ̃ m'ãfi ywel, yɔɔl kwɛn adza mbuul ondɛ wuo ãnzwel omɔ̃ mpaan! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Bee tsɔɔn emeeyɛɛn yɔ, mɛ̃ bvool eyɛɛn yɔ meba ŋã wɛn, ŋɛn mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ otee byɛ nsia yi ngesɛ yi ekam ye yi éyɔɔ byɛ, yɔɔl kwɛn adza ndɛ mpaan!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />M'emfa okyɛ, mɛ̃ ebii kwɛn baal akiool mɛ̃ wuo Nziã akiool mɛ̃? Mɛ̃ ebii kwɛn baal adzii mɛ̃? Okɛɛn mɛ̃ wu ekebii kwɛn baal adzii mɛ̃, kɛn mɛ̃ k'ekekal ɔ̃sal a Mãsia wɛ.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emfa ki éyɔɔ Pool Nsia yi Ngesɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Andoo a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ bam wɛn, Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi étee mɛ̃ k'éfi ola baal wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ k'éyɔɔ yɔ ola mbuul wɛ, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ k'éyio yɔ ola mbuul wɛ, kɛn a Yeso Mãsia ndyam mbuul wu áyɛɛl mɛ̃ yɔ. <verse eid="GAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Byɛ eyɛɛ epfuũ ki éli a mɛ̃ tsɔɔn, ŋ'ékenɔɔn mɛ̃ onkɔɔ b'Ayuda. Byɛ eyɛɛ emfa ki éketuaal mɛ̃ Ebvɔɔn e Nziã mpal yam bibi, bvool ékesa kwɛn lɔ etsɔɔn. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Onse onɔɔn b'onkɔɔ b'Ayuda, mɛ̃ ékenduru baal bibi b'áli nsiil ye mɛ̃, onse nki-nkii yi mɛ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ékenduru bɔ m'ebal ki ãndɔɔ m'ãtal onkɔɔ b'ankiɔɔn a mɛ̃. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Kɛn a Nziã ásueel mɛ̃ fa mwiĩ a ngoo a mɛ̃, bvool onse nyiĩ a ndɛ, ndɛ áti mɛ̃ mbel. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Ndɛ ámwɛn ngesɛ k'asuo mɛ̃ Muaan a ndɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ ntee Nsia a ndɛ yi Ngesɛ ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ. Mɛ̃ ke mbii luo ola mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ke ngyɛn onkyam Yelusalem ola b'áli antam ɛ̃kwel ɛ̃ mɛ̃ wɛ. Kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ ngyɛn nsie yi Alabi, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ mɛ̃ mvool nsie yi Damas. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Ke mbee a mvel tyel, mɛ̃ ngyɛn Yelusalem, kwɛn bia-Piɛɛl<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bakyɛ ati Piɛɛl ŋã me Sefas (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:42">Dzã 1.42</ref></char>).</note> eyɛɛ bakyɛ. Mɛ̃ nsi ãtsoo kuun y'ãtaan ola ndɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Mɛ̃ ke mwɛn ntam ɔ̃kyam wɛ, wu mwɛn mɛ̃ kɛn a Dzak wu muaan-ngoo a Mfam. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɔ ke nkwel a Nziã, ãndɔɔ m'ekel mɛ̃ byɛ mã, ãli mam taa-taa, mɛ̃ k'epfuru wɛ.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ ngyɛn m'etswi e nsie ki Sili ye ki Silisi. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, baal b'ãbvɔɔn ã Mãsia mã nsie yi Yude ale kɛn amwɛn mɛ̃ me mviil wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Kɛn a bɔ áyoo baal ayɛɛn ndiri: «Mbuul wɛn tsɔɔn áketuaal bia-byɛ mpal, meba ŋã oyii abetsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi okiool b'ékebii ndɛ obam.» <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Obobɔ, bɔ ákelweel Nziã me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s1">Pool y'antam bakyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Ke mbee a mvel kuun ye nã, mɛ̃ mvool Yelusalem ye Balanabas, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ mbiri Tite. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Mɛ̃ mvool okɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn Nziã áyɛɛl mɛ̃ ndɔɔ. Mɛ̃ nsuo bɔ Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ebetee mɛ̃ ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ nsuo yɔ me pyɛ ola baal b'anduru bvɛɛ. Mɛ̃ nsi obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ɔ̃sal wu emeesa mɛ̃ ye wu ebesa mɛ̃ abee wa ngwel okal. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, Tite wu áli ye mɛ̃, onkyam ŋɛn ndɛ oli Ɔ̃gelek, baal k'aywɛɛn k'atsiil ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Kɛn a ndɔɔ oyɔ epal, me ndɔɔ andoo ba pfuru, b'ásuɛɛn onse nkel a bia-byɛ, me ndɔɔ yi aliɔɔl bia-byɛ m'emfa ki eyii bia-byɛ ndii onse Yeso Mãsia. Bɔ asi obobɔ me ndɔɔ yi akaal bia-byɛ ankyal. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Kɛn a bee k'ewi bɔ mpwee si lio ngelemɔ̃ wɛ, k'eyoo bɔ bam wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn otaa-taa o Nsia yi Ngesɛ okal ɔ̃bu onse byɛ.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Me b'otal baal b'anduru bvɛɛ, onkyam ŋɛn bɔ áli baal b'emfa ke kyɛn, obɔ k'otal mɛ̃ bam wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã k'ali y'ɔ̃bɛɛ wɛ. Bɔ k'ali ye ndɔɔ yi eywɛɛn bɔ mɛ̃ osa wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Kɛn a bɔ amwɛn kwɛn Nziã owi mɛ̃ pfuũ li etee Nsia yi Ngesɛ ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, onge b'éwi ndɛ Piɛɛl lɔ li atee yɔ ol'Ayuda. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ ondɛ wu osuul Piɛɛl ntam ol'Ayuda, wu osuul mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ntam ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Dzak ye Piɛɛl ye Dzaã, b'ékewal baal onge ãkwii m'Ebvɔɔn, ŋ'emwɛn bɔ kwɛn Nziã áwi mɛ̃ pfuũ olɔ, bɔ anaan mɛ̃ ye Balanabas kuɔɔl, me ndɔɔ yi asuo kwɛn bɔ áli ɔ̃nguo ngɔmɔ̃ ye bee. Obobɔ, bee bueel ekuru kwɛn, bee, bee eyi ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, bɔ ayi ol'Ayuda. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Kɛn a bɔ asɔɔ ola bee k'etsam m'aywal. Mɛ̃ bu nsi ndɔɔ oyɔ ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool ye Piɛɛl k'Ãntioswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Kɛn a ŋ'éyi Piɛɛl Ãntioswe, ke nkwel a ndyam, mɛ̃ éwi ndɛ mbyel me ndɔɔ yi ési ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ ási obi-obi. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Nzal a ŋɛn, ye k'eya baal ke kwɛ b'éyuɔɔl Dzak, Piɛɛl ákedza mboo mɔ̃ y'andoo bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ. Kɛn a ŋ'etɔ baal obɔ, ndɛ odzuru nzuru, bu atsɔɔn ye b'ékedza a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ ákebal Ayuda. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Ayuda bakyɛ asam onse pfuru olɔ ye ndɛ, onkyam Balanabas hɛ̃ osam onse oliin obɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Kɛn a ŋe mwɛn mɛ̃ kwɛn bɔ k'adzuu dzu m'emfa ki otaa-taa o Nsia yi Ngesɛ wɛ, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn ye Piɛɛl ke mviil ã baal bueel bubu: «Okɛɛn yɛ wu Ɔ̃yuda yɛ akal m'emfa ki baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, ke m'emfa ki Ayuda wɛ, obobɔ emfa emã ki eywɛɛn yɛ baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ k'akal onge Ayuda?»<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayuda ye bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ abvuul m'okiool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Bia-byɛ mpii Ayuda b'emburu-ngoo eli, k'eli baal b'ãyam ãkyam b'ali y'ãbi wɛ.<verse eid="GAL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Kɛn a bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn mbuul k'akoo k'akal dzu m'okiaal o Ngel a Moyize wɛ, eli kɛn a m'okiool me Yeso Mãsia. Obobɔ, bia-byɛ hɛ̃ elɔ okiool onse Yeso Mãsia me ndɔɔ yɛn Nziã asuul bia-byɛ dzu me nkuul a okiool me Mãsia, ke me ndɔɔ olweel o Ngel wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'akoo k'akal dzu m'okiaal o Ngel wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Kɛn a ŋ'ebii bia-byɛ k'ekal dzu onse Mãsia, ŋɛn bia-byam hɛ̃ éli anga-ãbi. Ŋ'edzii k'eyɛɛn ndiri Mãsia oli ɔ̃sal a obi? K'obobɔ bam wɛ! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Okɛɛn mɛ̃ bvool efaal ãndɔɔ ã Ngel m'étsal mɛ̃, ŋ'esuo kwɛn mɛ̃ ndi mbuul wu efel Ngel. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃, me nkuul a Ngel, mɛ̃ emeekwa me ndɔɔ a yɔ, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ mɛ̃ nkal y'elaã me ndɔɔ a Nziã. Ábɛɛl mɛ̃ m'enkulusu ye Mãsia: <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Mɛ̃ ke ndi bvool mwiĩ wɛ, wu oli mwiĩ onse mɛ̃ eli Mãsia. Elaã li ndi a mɛ̃ meba onse nzuru, mɛ̃ ndi ye lɔ me nkuul a okiool me Muaan a Nziã wu ádzii mɛ̃ bvool áwi elaã e ndɛ me ndyam me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Mɛ̃ k'ebee nyiĩ a Nziã wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn mbuul akal dzu m'okiaal o Ngel, ŋɛn epfu li ékwi Mãsia k'eli y'otsɛn wɛ.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ngel wuo okiool?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Aa Afi-Ngalati, baal b'aywɛn a ãyal! Mbuul wu opuul byɛ nã? Byɛ bɛn ke nkwel a byɛ abwɛɛl ngesɛ-ngesɛ ndɔɔ a Yeso Mãsia wu ákwi m'enkulusu. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn byɛ ebveel mɛ̃ kɛn ɔ̃mfuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu: Byɛ éyɔɔ Ɔ̃fel me ndɔɔ yi ékieel byɛ Ngel wuo me nkuul a Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi éyoo byɛ y'okiool? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Byɛ bu eyii ãyal pyɛ bubu! Byɛ ebɛɛn m'Ɔ̃fel, meba edzii k'esɛɛl m'ombuul? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Mbueel m'emwɛn byɛ mã ngwel ãkal? Mɔ̃ k'ãkoo k'ãkal mã ngwel wɛ! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Nziã wu awa byɛ Ɔ̃fel, bvool abesa emvieel onse byɛ, byɛ bu etsam wɛn ndɛ abesa bvɛ me ndɔɔ yi ebekiaal byɛ Ngel wuo me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eyoo Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ekiool byɛ?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Emeetal Abalayam: «Ndɛ álɔ okiool me Nziã, me ndɔɔ okiool o ndɛ, Nziã osiɔɔl ndɛ onge mbuul wa dzu.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Obɛ 15.6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Oŋɔ̃ eyɛɛ kwɛn b'ali y'okiool, bɔ obɔ b'ali baan b'Abalayam. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Ɔ̃nkaan ámwɛn ŋ'ɛ̃kwel kwɛn Nziã akieel asuul baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ dzu m'okiool o bɔ. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ndɛ ále tsɔɔn ámaawa ndɛ wu Abalayam Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ndiri: «Ãyam mam mbueel m'ɔ̃kiri ãkieel ãbɔɔ ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl me nkuũ a yɛ.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Obɛ 12.3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Obobɔ, baal b'akiool ali y'ondɔɔl o kuool y'Abalayam wu nga-ɔ̃kiool.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Kɛn a baal b'akuru nzuru me Ngel ali baal bɛn ádzi bɔ mpaan. Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel bubu: «Mbuul ndyam wueel wɛn lio lam lueel k'abekiaal m'ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan a Ngel wɛ, àdza ndɛ mpaan.» <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Obobɔ, eli kal-a-kal kwɛn, ke nkwel a Nziã, mbuul k'akoo k'akal dzu m'okiaal o Ngel wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ákel bubu: «Mbuul wa dzu àkal y'elaã m'okiool!» <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Kwɛn ŋɛn Ngel k'efi onse okiool wɛ. Kɛn a yɔ eyɛɛn ndiri: «Mbuul wu asa ãndɔɔ m'etam Ngel, àkal y'elaã me nkuul a yɔ.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Det 27.26</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Mãsia ápaal bia-byɛ onse odza o mpaan o Ngel, ŋ'eyii ndɛ mbuul wu adzi mpaan me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel bubu: «Odza o mpaan òkal nkal a mbuul wu aliɔɔl m'ɔ̃ti.» <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Ási obobɔ, kwɛn oŋɔ̃, baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ abɔɔ ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl b'Abalayam me nkuul a Yeso Mãsia, bvool me ndɔɔ yɛn me nkuul a okiool, bia-byɛ ebɔɔ Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu éwi Nziã lɔɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngel y'ãndɔɔ m'élieel Nziã ndiri àsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Andoo a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ me ngyɛɛn m'emfa ki ebeyɛɛn baal. Ŋɛn baal buaal akuru k'asa ndɔɔ m'emfa ki ebvaan me bɔ ange-buaal, bu alab ɔ̃kyel wu asa ndɔɔ oyɔ, mbuul ɔ̃kyam k'akoo k'ayembaal wuo ayelweel ndɔɔ wɛ, k'obobɔ wɛ? <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Emfa kiki, Nziã ál'amaawa Abalayam ye muaan a ndɛ lɔ. Ɔ̃nkaan k'álieel ndiri: «Ye baan a ndɛ wɛ», oŋɔ̃ bɛn baal ali bibi. Muaan wu álieel ondɛ, eli kɛn a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃. Mbuul ondɛ, eli Mãsia.<verse eid="GAL 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Etal be nzii mɛ̃ oyɛɛn: Nziã átɛn ondoo y'Abalayam m'emfa ki abesa. Ke mbee amveel ɛ̃nkam ɛ̃na y'ãku-ãtyel (430), ndɛ áwi Ngel ola Moyize. Obobɔ, yɔ k'ekoo k'etsal bɔ, kwɛn esuul lɔɔ li éwi Nziã Abalayam ekal otsɛn pyɛ wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul k'abɔɔ ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl o Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi ekiaal ndɛ Ngel wɛ. Abalayam ŋ'ábɔɔ ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl b'éwi Nziã lɔɔ, me ndɔɔ a nyiĩ a Nziã.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otsɛn b'áwi Ngel omã?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />K'otsɛn o ngel omã? Nziã álweel Ngel me ndɔɔ yɛn yɔ esuo ãbi ã baal. Ndɛ ási obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn baal alweel yɔ, tiil k'éyi ɔ̃tiɔɔl a Abalayam wɛn Nziã áwi ndɛ wu Abalayam lɔɔ me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. Nziã ábwel me nkuul a ãnzwel me ndɔɔ yi awa Ngel ola mbuul wu abveel ondoo. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Wu abveel ondoo k'ali kɛn a wa mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛ. Kɛn a Nziã oli ndyam-sii m'ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl b'élieel ndɛ ndiri àwa Abalayam.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Obobɔ, ngel k'eyi nkuul mɔ̃ y'ãlɔɔ ã Nziã wɛ? K'obobɔ bam wɛ! Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn eli ye ngel ngamɔ̃ yi ewa baal elaã, kɛn baal akaakal dzu ke nkwel a Nziã m'okiaal o yɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Kɛn Ɔ̃nkaan ayɛɛn ndiri ɔ̃kiri ɔ̃tsiin oli onse onkyal b'obi, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ akiool abɔɔ kab li éwi Nziã lɔɔ, me nkuul a okiool o bɔ me Yeso Mãsia.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Ye k'eya lio li okiool, Ngel ékwee bia-byɛ onse bwal, tiil k'esuo Nziã okiool obɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Obobɔ, Ngel éli onge mbiri a bia-byɛ ola Mãsia, kwɛn bia-byɛ ekal dzu me nkuul a okiool. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Ŋ'emeeya lio li okiool, mbiri ondɛ bvool k'abebiri bia-byɛ wɛ.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Byɛ bam bueel eli baan a Nziã me nkuul a okiool me Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ bam bueel b'émeebvɔɔn mboo mɔ̃ ye Mãsia onse opongo, emeelaal ndɛ onge ekɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Okam k'obekal wɛ mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ Ɔ̃yuda ye wɛn k'Ɔ̃yuda wɛ, mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a ɔ̃nkyal ye mbuul wa ndii, mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ ɔ̃kaal ye bɔɔl, ke ngwel wɛ byɛ bam bueel eyii mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ onse Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Okɛɛn byɛ eyii baal a Mãsia, byɛ ŋ'eyii yam li Abalayam li ebɔɔ ɔ̃swal m'emfa ki éwi Nziã lɔɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Etal be nzii mɛ̃ oyɛɛn: Ŋ'eli mbuul wu awal ɔ̃swal kɛn muaan wu ɔ̃bwee, ndɛ k'ali y'okam y'ɔ̃nkyal wɛ, onkyam ŋɛn ndɛ oli mfam a eluɔ e tal a ndɛ bvieel. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Ndɛ oli me mviɔɔl mi asal b'atal ndɛ ye b'akiaal opfel o ndɛ, tiil k'ekoo lio li éyɛɛl tal. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Eli emfa kiki hɛ̃ me bia-byɛ. Ŋ'éli bia-byɛ kɛn baan b'abwee, ɛ̃kiri y'ãngel m'ɔ̃kiri ã́kenyam bia-byɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Kɛn a ŋ'ékoo lio li éwɛɛ Nziã, ndɛ áyuɔɔl Muaan a ndɛ wu áburu m'ɔ̃kaal. Muaan ondɛ ákal ke nsɛn okwɛn o Ngel. <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />Nziã áyuɔɔl ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi abvuul baal b'áli ke nsɛn a okwɛn o Ngel. Ndɛ osi obobɔ, kwɛn ndɛ asuul bia-byɛ ekal baan a ndyam. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eyii baan a ndɛ, Nziã oyuɔɔl Ɔ̃fel a Muaan a ndɛ onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bia-byɛ. Ɔ̃fel ondɛ abebiool ndiri: «Aba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Aba» m'ɔ̃nywã wu alameyɛ̃, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri: «Taal».</char></note>! Taal!» <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Yɛ bvool ke li ɔ̃nkyal wɛ, yɛ muaan li. Okɛɛn yɛ li muaan, Nziã hɛ̃ àwa yɛ ɔ̃swal wu élieel ndɛ me ndɔɔ a baan a ndɛ.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool akɛɛ nguo m'Afi-Ngalati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Byɛ tsɔɔn k'éyɛɛ Nziã wɛ, obɔ otsɛn bɛn byɛ éli ankyal b'etiɔ bvɛn, ke yam, k'eli anziã wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Kɛn a meba, byɛ emeeyɛɛ Nziã, wuo mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn wɛn ndɛ amaayɛɛ byɛ. K'otsɛn omã b'ekɔɔl byɛ me ndɔɔ yi elweel ɛ̃fel, mi ɛ̃ywɛn a waan bvool mi ngwel-a-ngwel? Byɛ bvool edzii k'ekɔɔl ankyal a myɛ̃? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Byɛ ebekiaal ãtsoo m'ãpfuun, y'answii, y'ɛ̃bvu, y'amvel! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Mɛ̃ ekɛɛ nguo me byɛ, owɛɛl ɔ̃sal wu mwɛn mɛ̃ fool me ndɔɔ a byɛ oyeyi ngwel.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Andoo a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ nduɔɔn byɛ wɛn esa onge mɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ngyii onge byɛ. Byɛ k'esi mɛ̃ ndɔɔ yi mbi si ngamɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Byɛ eyɛɛ ãndɔɔ m'ãbwel. Mɔ̃ m'ãsi kwɛn mɛ̃ yentee byɛ Nsia yi Ngesɛ sa yi ɛ̃kwel. Mɛ̃ éli y'oluu, <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />nzuru a mɛ̃ k'éli ngesɛ m'otal wɛ. Byɛ k'eyiri mɛ̃ wɛ, k'ebyel mɛ̃ hɛ̃ wɛ. Kɛn a byɛ eyɔɔ mɛ̃ onge ãnzwel ã Nziã, bam onge Yeso Mãsia ndyam. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Oŋɔ̃ esɛ ki éli a byɛ kwɛn? Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a byɛ wɛn, okɛɛn byɛ ekeepeel mviil ã byɛ me ndɔɔ yi ewa mɛ̃ mɔ̃, byɛ al'ekoo m'osa obobɔ! <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Meba ŋã, mɛ̃ ngyii ɔ̃taal a byɛ me ndɔɔ yi eliaal mɛ̃ byɛ otaa-taa?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Ebal ki esuo andoo ba pfuru obɔ byɛ k'eli kyɛ-a-kyɛ wɛ. Bɔ adzii kɛn a k'akab byɛ ye mɛ̃, kwɛn byɛ ekuru nzuru me bɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Me b'otal byɛ, eli ngesɛ kwɛn byɛ esuo ebal me ndɔɔ yi mvɛ-mvɛ lio lam lueel, ke kɛn a ŋe ndi mɛ̃ onse byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Baan a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ mwiĩ bvool abaan me ndɔɔ a byɛ, onge ɔ̃kaal wu oyii ayi oburu, tiil lio li etuu Mãsia nzuru onse elaã e byɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Meba ŋã, mɛ̃ nzii bam k'ekal ye byɛ me ndɔɔ yi eswɛɛl emfa ki eyɛɛn ye byɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ãyal ãmaãfa me ndɔɔ a byɛ.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mboo a Agaal ye Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Byɛ b'edzii k'ekal ke nsɛn okwɛn o Ngel, eyɛɛn mɛ̃, byɛ k'eyoo k'eyɛɛn yɔ wɛ? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel ndiri Abalayam áli ye baan b'abɔɔl buaal, wɛn ndɛ oburu y'ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃nkyal, wɛn ndɛ oburu y'ɔ̃kaal wɛn k'ɔ̃nkyal wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Muaan wu éburu ndɛ y'ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃nkyal, wu áburu m'emfa ki ombuul. Kɛn a wu éburu ndɛ y'ɔ̃kaal wɛn k'ɔ̃nkyal wɛ, wu áburu m'emfa e lɔɔ li éwi Nziã.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Ndɔɔ oyɔ eli mboo. Akaal obɔ asuo emfa bviaal bvi ondoo. Agaal, eli ondoo b'átɛn ke nkio yi Sinayi. Baal bueel b'aburu onse yam e ndɛ ali ankyal. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Agaal hɛ̃, eli nkio yi Sinayi k'ɔ̃kiri wu Alabi. Ndɛ bvool asuo bviil li Yelusalem li meba, ke ngwel wɛ baal a bviil olɔ ali onse onkyal ye baan a bɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Kɛn a Yelusalem wa ywel k'ali m'onkyal wɛ, ndɛ wu oli ngoo a bia-byɛ wa taa-taa. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">«Sia mpaa, yɛ wu ɔ̃kaal wu empi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">yɛ wɛn ke li ye muaan wɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Sia mpaa bibi bvool kuaal ɛ̃sɔɔl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">yɛ wɛn ke yɛɛ mpuru a k'ebaan mwiĩ me ndɔɔ oburu wɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Ke ngwel wɛ, baan b'ɔ̃kaal wu áyiri akieel anduru b'ɔ̃kaal wa y'ɔ̃lam<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Edz 54.1</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Andoo, me b'otal byɛ, emfa ngemɔ̃ onge Isak, byɛ eli baan b'aburu m'emfa e lɔɔ li éwi Nziã. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Kɛn emfa kiki kyɛn tsɔɔn muaan wu áburu m'emfa ki ombuul áketuaal muaan wu áburu m'Ɔ̃fel mpal, nonɔ̃ ŋã hɛ̃ eli kɛn obobɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />K'Ɔ̃nkaan omã ayɛɛn? Ndɛ ayɛɛn bubu: «Tswɛɛl ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃nkyal ye muaan a ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ muaan ondɛ kieel k'akab ɔ̃swal ye wu ɔ̃kaal wɛn k'ɔ̃nkyal wɛ wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:9-10">Obɛ 21.9-10</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Obobɔ, andoo, bia-byɛ k'eli baan b'ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃nkyal wɛ, bia-byɛ eli baan b'ɔ̃kaal wɛn k'ɔ̃nkyal wɛ.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s1">Okal ndii me Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Mãsia opaal bia-byɛ onse ebwal, kwɛn bia-byɛ ekal bam ndii. Obobɔ, bia-byɛ etɛɛn ye mpɛn, me ndɔɔ yi ebee onse ebwal ki onkyal obekɔɔl. <verse eid="GAL 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, okɛɛn byɛ ewi nzuru kwɛn atsiil byɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pool awa Afi-Ngalati mbyel me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ákewa ãnzuru kwɛn atsiil mɔ̃, me ndɔɔ yi akal dzu.</char></note>, ŋɛn Mãsia k'àbekal y'otsɛn me ndɔɔ a byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Mɛ̃ bvool eyɛɛn byɛ bam wɛn, mbuul wueel wu awa nzuru kwɛn atsiil ndɛ, ebvaan ndɛ akiaal Ngel yam yueel hɛ̃. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Byɛ baal b'ebii k'ekal dzu m'okiaal o Ngel, byɛ ŋ'ekab nzuru ye Mãsia. Byam ŋ'epal onse nyiĩ a Nziã. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Me b'otal bia-byɛ b'eli y'okiool, bia-byɛ ebeta kaã wɛn Nziã àsuul bia-byɛ dzu. Ɔ̃fel wu asa kwɛn bia-byɛ ekiaal ndɔɔ oyɔ ɔ̃kwal mbaa-mbaa. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Ke ngwel wɛ, onse Mãsia, ndɔɔ yi nkiin k'otsiil o nzuru wuo obee o nzuru otsiil wɛ. Ndɔɔ yi nkiin eli kɛn okiool b'osuo nzuru me dzii.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Byɛ éketsuu ntiin ngesɛ. Mbuul nã wu otɛɛl byɛ, kwɛn byɛ ebee otaa-taa obelweel? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Ãtsam m'obobɔ k'ãfi ola wu oti byɛ mbel wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Muaan-lebviil etsi-tsiri asuul pɔtɔ-pɔtɔ ndyam wueel afel. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Mɛ̃ ndyam ndi ye kaã me byɛ onse Mfam wɛn, byɛ k'ètsam emfa ekyam wɛ. Kɛn a mbuul ɔ̃bi pyɛ wu alɔ ɛ̃tsab onse byɛ, àbɔɔ etumbu. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Andoo a mɛ̃, me b'otal mɛ̃, okɛɛn mɛ̃ kɛn ebetee wɛn otsiil o nzuru oli y'otsɛn, ke ndɔɔ mã yi abetuaal mɛ̃ mpal kɛn otuaal? Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn mɛ̃ ebetee obobɔ, enkulusu e Mãsia k'ebekal ndɔɔ yi ebal mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ wɛ! <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Bɔ obɔ b'alɔ byɛ ɛ̃tsab, ametɔ tiil m'ombaal b'obɔɔl o bam!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Byɛ b'andoo a mɛ̃, Nziã áti byɛ mbel kwɛn byɛ ekal ndii. Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn okal ndii o byɛ obɔ obee mpwee yi esa byɛ m'etam efua bvi ombuul okal. Yɔɔl kwɛn me dzii, byɛ ekal asal a bakyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Ngel yueel eli onse ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃ yi: «Yɛ àdzii ngaburu-mbuul onge b'edzii yɛ nzuru a yam<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Kɛn a ŋɛn byɛ etswa bakyɛ miin bvool ekɔɔl bakyɛ, ekal y'onkyab byɛ ol'eyesiɛɛn k'obam o bakyɛ!<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emfa ki edzuu ɔ̃kiool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ bubu: Edzuu m'Ɔ̃fel, obobɔ byɛ k'èsa ãndɔɔ m'etam efua bvi ombuul osa wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, efua bvi ombuul k'eta y'Ɔ̃fel wɛ, efua bvi Ɔ̃fel hɛ̃ k'eta y'ombuul wɛ. Bɔ ange-buaal ali onse eta, m'emfa kyɛn byɛ k'ekoo k'esa b'edzii byɛ osa wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Kɛn okɛɛn Ɔ̃fel abiri byɛ, byɛ k'ebekal ke nsɛn a okwɛn o Ngel wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Efua bvi ombuul ebemɔɔn m'ãndɔɔ mã: Obvool o ntal ye mbuul wɛn byɛ kɛn ebaal bakyɛ wɛ, ãndɔɔ mã mbiin, ãndɔɔ m'esio, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />olweel b'anziã ba mfya, ebel, byal, ɛ̃tsuun, nsɔɔ, ãmpuru, ombɔɔ, ɛ̃kɔɔl, otsɔɔn ye bakyɛ, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />ɔ̃tam, obɔɔ o mbal, odza y'onywã b'onduru ɔ̃ndel, y'ãndɔɔ mãkyɛ mɛn onge omɔ̃. Mɛ̃ ewa byɛ ãnkunkwa onge b'ewi mɛ̃ byɛ mɔ̃ tsɔɔn wɛn, baal b'asa ãndɔɔ mã m'emfa okyɛ, bɔ k'àsam Okwɛn o Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Kɛn Ɔ̃fel abeburu eluɔ bvi: dzii, esɛ, opi, osɛ-mwiĩ, owuaal o bakyɛ, obvɛ, okiool, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />efyɛ, okuru b'ɔ̃kwal. Ngel k'ebee ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Baal ba Yeso Mãsia ámaakwal ãtsam m'ombuul y'efua bvi ombuul m'enkulusu. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Onge bɛn bia-byɛ eli y'elaã m'Ɔ̃fel, edzuu m'emfa ki edzii ndɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Bia-byɛ ebee y'ondɛɛl o nzuru okal, ebee bakyɛ opoo, ebee bakyɛ ɔ̃kwal olɔ.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s1">Obiri b'ãtswel ã bakyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Andoo a mɛ̃, okɛɛn mbuul okiɔɔl y'elyal ngemɔ̃ bubu, byɛ b'edzuu m'Ɔ̃fel, ebveel ndɛ me nkuul onse efyɛ. Kɛn a yam kal y'onkyab, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ yɛ hɛ̃ bee onse ɔ̃mbio obva. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Ebiri ãtswel ã bakyɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ ol'esi b'etam ngel a Mãsia osa. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Okɛɛn mbuul atsam ndiri ndɛ oli mbuul a bvɛɛ, kwɛn ŋɛn ndɛ otsɛn pyɛ, ndɛ nzuru a ndyam apfuru. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul abwɛɛl m'ebesa ndyam, m'emfa okyɛ ndɛ ol'obɔɔ ndɔɔ yi ebɛɛl ndɛ ntwel me ndyam, ke m'owal b'emvɛɛl me mbuul ɔ̃kyam wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul bwɛn a mbuul àbiri pfuũ e ndyam.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul wɛn abetee ndɛ Endɔɔ e Nziã, akab eluɔ e ndɛ bvieel ye mbuul wu abetee ndɛ lɔ.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Ebee ãnzuru ã byam opfuru: K'abesyob Nziã wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ki èkwɛn mbuul, ki ètsam ndɛ hɛ̃. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu akwɛn m'emfa ki etam efua bvi ombuul, àtsam ki èburu ombuul, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri epfu. Kɛn a mbuul wu akwɛn m'emfa ki etam Ɔ̃fel, àtsam ki èburu Ɔ̃fel, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Bia-byɛ ebee owɔɔl m'osa b'obvɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn bia-byɛ k'ewɔɔl wɛ, bia-byɛ ekieel etsam me lio li ngesɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Obobɔ, ŋ'eli bia-byɛ ye mpwee, esa obvɛ me baal bueel, bvel-bvel ola baal ba yam li akiool.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãnkunkwa mã ntɔ y'ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Etal ãmpiri m'ãnɛn mã. Mɛ̃ ŋe nswɛn byɛ me kuɔɔl e myam.<verse eid="GAL 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Baal bueel b'abeywɛɛn byɛ k'etsiil nzuru ali b'adzii kwɛn atal bɔ m'emfa ki ombuul. Bɔ k'adzii kwɛn atuaal bɔ mpal me ndɔɔ epfu e Mãsia m'enkulusu wɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bam b'abewa ãnzuru otsiil, bɔ k'abekiaal Ngel wɛ. Kɛn a bɔ adzii kwɛn atsiil byɛ ãnzuru, kwɛn bɔ akal y'ondɛɛl o nzuru m'ãnzuru ã byɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Me b'otal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ bam ntwel m'eluɔ ekyam obɛɛl wɛ, mɛ̃ ebɛɛl ntwel kɛn a m'epfu e Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia m'enkulusu. Me nkuul a ndɛ, ámaabɛɛl ɔ̃kiri m'enkulusu me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃, emfa kiki ámaabɛɛl mɛ̃ hɛ̃ m'enkulusu me ndɔɔ ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɔɔ yi nkiin k'otsiil o nzuru wuo obee o nzuru otsiil wɛ. Ndɔɔ yi nkiin, yi akal mbuul wu ɔ̃nyiɔɔn wu ebuo Nziã. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Yɔɔl kwɛn opi ye nyiĩ ekal ye baal b'anɔɔn k'asa ndɔɔ oyɔ, ekal hɛ̃ y'Isalayel e Nziã!<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Bɛɛn nonɔ̃, yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bvool abee mɛ̃ mpal obetuaal! Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ebebiri eliĩ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eliĩ bvi ayɛɛn ŋã, esuo ãmpal m'émwɛn Pool me ndɔɔ a dzii li édzii ndɛ Mãsia. Ãmpal omɔ̃, mɔ̃ mã: ãluu (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 4:13">Nga 4.13</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 12:7">2Ko 12.7</ref></char>), ɔ̃dzii (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 11:25">2Ko 11.25</ref></char>), ãwua (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:8">1Ko 1.8</ref></char>). </note> e Yeso me nzuru a mɛ̃. <verse eid="GAL 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Andoo, yɔɔl kwɛn Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia asio byɛ nyiĩ! Amɛn!<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>